I want to do `SetGlobalLevel(ParseLevel(process.env.LOG_LEVEL ?? "info"))`, but `ParseLevel` (in `src/log/level.ts`) isn't exported from the package entry point, so I have to copy it.

```ts
import { SetGlobalLevel } from "ctx-log";
// import { ParseLevel } from "ctx-log"; // TS2305: Module has no exported member 'ParseLevel'
```

Could it be added to the public exports?
